            "The archive indexes more than 613 distinct policy sections organized across twelve topic groups: Employment Basics, Leave & Time Off, Benefits, Conduct & Culture, Discipline & Performance, Legal & Compliance, Technology & Data, Safety & Property, Finance & Vendors, Employment Lifecycle, Communications & Collaboration, and Compensation. For each company, the archive preserves multiple handbook revisions per year, enabling researchers, HR practitioners, and workforce policy analysts to trace the precise evolution of corporate policy language — including the specific moments when organizations quietly updated their remote work eligibility thresholds, revised their social media use restrictions, or recalibrated their progressive discipline procedures.",
